    Open-Source Mathematical & DSP References (GPLv3 Compatible):
    - Voice Dispersion & CEM Topology: OB-Xd (https://github.com/2DaT/Obxd)
    - ZDF/TPT Ladder & Cytomic SVF Filters: Surge XT sst-filters (https://github.com/surge-synthesizer/sst-filters)
    - BBD Stereo Chorus (MN3009): YKChorus / TAL Chorus (https://github.com/SpotlightKid/ykchorus)
    - Hybrid Plate/FDN Reverb: CloudSeed (https://github.com/ValdemarOrn/CloudSeed) & Signalsmith (https://github.com/Signalsmith-Audio/reverb-example-code)
    - Plugin Wrapper Architecture: NIH-plug (https://github.com/robbert-vdh/nih-plug)
